# ORVEX MQTT Access Control List (ACL) Template
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Backend Gateway Account: Full read/write access to all ORVEX topics
user orvex_gateway
topic readwrite orvex/#

# 2. Plant Edge Ingestion Account: Can publish telemetry and heartbeat
user orvex_edge_node
topic write orvex/v1/machines/+/telemetry
topic write orvex/v1/machines/+/heartbeat

# 3. Read-Only Auditor / Plant Monitor Account
user orvex_auditor
topic read orvex/#

